[FINAL-TEXT] ## Phase 5 — Confirmed Root Cause

I have direct evidence of the fault fingerprint on the owning device:

**srv1 / named.conf:**
- `recursion no` is **explicitly set** in `/etc/bind/named.conf`
- named IS listening on `10.5.0.4:53` (confirmed by ss -tlnp)
- No nftables/iptables rules block port 53 on srv1
- named only serves the `jeremysitlab.com` zone authoritatively — all external queries return `REFUSED`
- pc1's `/etc/resolv.conf` → `nameserver 10.5.0.4` — pointing to this crippled resolver
